1
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:42,480
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:47,600
[Episode 2: Only Nanfeng Knows Me]

3
00:00:56,680 --> 00:00:57,760
If you wanted to,

4
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,860
you would have done it last night.

5
00:01:21,080 --> 00:01:22,520
You're beautiful,

6
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:25,039
but I would never take advantage of

7
00:01:25,039 --> 00:01:26,970
someone when they're vulnerable.

8
00:01:52,039 --> 00:01:53,360
I've gone back in time?

9
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:55,600
This is really happening.

10
00:02:10,199 --> 00:02:11,640
In my last life,

11
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:13,240
I missed the graduation application

12
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:14,360
and lost my degree on this very day.

13
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:16,690
That left me playing catch-up ever since.

14
00:02:20,010 --> 00:02:20,930
This time,

15
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:22,690
I won't let it happen again.

16
00:02:30,910 --> 00:02:33,550
Only Nanfeng Knows Me.

17
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:35,940
My name is Xie Nanfeng.

18
00:02:36,350 --> 00:02:37,079
Remember me.

19
00:02:37,430 --> 00:02:38,890
Why should I remember you?

20
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:43,400
Because I have the patent you want.

21
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:44,440
And I'm

22
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,800
the intern you've been looking for.

23
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,000
Xie Nanfeng?

24
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,970
What are you doing in a place like this?

25
00:03:38,980 --> 00:03:42,020
I knew you were a cheap slut.

26
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:50,310
You're here to see Chu Chunsheng,
aren't you?

27
00:03:50,310 --> 00:03:51,440
Then you can go back.

28
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:53,300
You've lost your investment.

29
00:03:53,510 --> 00:03:55,840
What nonsense are you talking about here?

30
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,200
Mr. Chu!

31
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,000
Mr. Chu, you're here.

32
00:04:02,040 --> 00:04:02,680
I came here today

33
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,040
specifically to talk to you about that...

34
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:05,570
Patent investment, right?

35
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:08,650
Then you should have a good chat
with Mr. Chu.

36
00:04:08,650 --> 00:04:11,370
What are the key points
of this pattern design?

37
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:15,550
Well...

38
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:17,959
Those are all introduced in the document.

39
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:18,640
Mr. Chu,

40
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:20,480
I went to your factory late last night

41
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:22,440
with the file and waited for you,

42
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,400
but you never showed.

43
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:24,760
So first thing this morning, I...

44
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:26,890
You left something behind last night.

45
00:04:32,690 --> 00:04:33,450
Mr. Chu,

46
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,570
did she tell you something?

47
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:36,680
Don't believe a word she said.

48
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:38,159
She's just trying to take credit.

49
00:04:38,159 --> 00:04:39,840
I only care about the patent itself.

50
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:41,100
Whoever can produce it

51
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:42,480
gets

52
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:44,380
my investment.

53
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:51,300
Chang Yongbin,

54
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,320
you'd better remember this:

55
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:01,000
my name is signed on that patent.

56
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,420
Don't even think about

57
00:05:02,420 --> 00:05:04,580
using it to get ahead,

58
00:05:04,810 --> 00:05:06,810
in this life or the next.

59
00:05:10,720 --> 00:05:11,280
Mr. Chu,

60
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:11,960
let me explain.

61
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:13,080
She's just an intern.

62
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:13,960
She's only trying to use me to get ahead.

63
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:15,490
Please, don't believe her!

64
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:16,120
Mr. Chu,

65
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,930
you left something behind too.

66
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,760
The latest central government
directive is out:

67
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:55,000
restrictions on business
will continue to be eased,

68
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:55,960
and private factories
are being encouraged.

69
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:56,920
Hello, Wang.

70
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:59,040
What about those
imported electronic watches I asked for?

71
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:00,280
Yes, yes, yes.

72
00:06:00,280 --> 00:06:03,080
The batch of Japanese electronic watches
we talked about last time.

73
00:06:03,080 --> 00:06:03,600
When will they arrive?

74
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,740
The latest Special
Economic Zone Evening News!

75
00:06:05,740 --> 00:06:07,720
"Dare to venture,
dare to experiment, dare to lead!

76
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:09,480
Building the Special Economic Zone
and striving to stay ahead!"

77
00:06:09,480 --> 00:06:11,160
I'll take you to Huaqiangbei
for a stroll later.

78
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:13,040
I heard a lot of electronic stalls
have opened there.

79
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,000
They're selling all kinds of
cutting-edge gadgets.

80
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:16,800
Our factory's been so busy with orders
lately, we can barely keep up.

81
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:19,400
The boss says we're getting a raise
this month!

82
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:22,000
I want as many as possible.

83
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,600
Don't worry.

84
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:24,970
They'll all sell.

85
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:25,960
I want imported ones.

86
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:27,200
1991.

87
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:28,760
I'm back.

88
00:06:29,920 --> 00:06:30,840
Breaking news.

89
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:33,040
Shencheng has fully opened up
commercial trade,

90
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,880
encouraging individuals to set up
street stalls

91
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:35,920
and open shops.

92
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,400
Approval procedures have been streamlined,

93
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:38,840
lowering the barriers
to starting a business

94
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:39,960
and giving ordinary people a chance
to seize new opportunities.

95
00:06:39,960 --> 00:06:42,400
The Special Economic Zone is seeing
a new wave of investment.

96
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:45,720
Hong Kong and foreign businesses are pouring in
to set up factories and form partnerships,

97
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:47,800
creating a surge in jobs.

98
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:48,840
Factories can't keep up with demand.

99
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:52,700
In 1991, the winds of reform
and opening-up swept through Shencheng,

100
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:56,640
bringing new opportunities
and new possibilities everywhere.

101
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:58,400
I will take back everything

102
00:06:58,600 --> 00:07:00,060
I lost in my previous life.

103
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:02,200
Okay.

104
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:04,000
Let's start with my diploma

105
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,800
and Lin Shuang.

106
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:09,560
Next, let's welcome Lin Shuang

107
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:11,760
to the stage to receive her diploma!

108
00:07:14,840 --> 00:07:17,720
Your thesis was named one of the outstanding
theses of this graduating class.

109
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:20,080
You're hereby awarded an
Outstanding Graduate Certificate.

110
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:21,120
Congratulations.

111
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,480
Lin Shuang is so amazing.

112
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:24,920
Our department only has one spot
for a Shencheng residency,

113
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,080
and it's definitely going to her.

114
00:07:26,080 --> 00:07:27,080
She has a bright future ahead of her.

115
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:28,320
I don't think so.

116
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:34,400
Xie Nanfeng?

117
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:37,520
You've already been disqualified
from graduating.

118
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:38,850
What are you doing here?

119
00:07:39,760 --> 00:07:40,890
In my past life,

120
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,320
you plagiarized my thesis

121
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:43,840
and kept me from graduating.

122
00:07:43,840 --> 00:07:45,040
Then you got close to Chang Yongbin,

123
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:47,500
thinking you could take everything
from me.

124
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:48,640
In this life,

125
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:51,200
it's your turn to find out how it feels.

126
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:54,080
Of course I'm here to congratulate you.

127
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,640
You plagiarized my thesis

128
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:59,400
and still managed to graduate with honors.

129
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:00,320
Xie Nanfeng,

130
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:02,800
you're making wild accusations

131
00:08:02,800 --> 00:08:04,400
without a shred of evidence.

132
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,120
Lin Shuang

133
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,640
is dating the principal's son.

134
00:08:08,840 --> 00:08:10,240
She's got a bright future

135
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,640
ahead of her.

136
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:14,440
Why would Lin Shuang ever
need to plagiarize her work?

137
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:15,900
Of course I have evidence.

138
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:18,680
Mr. Zhang,

139
00:08:18,700 --> 00:08:21,620
this is the earliest draft
of my graduation thesis.

140
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:24,080
It has Mr. Zhou's handwritten notes

141
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:25,680
and revisions.

142
00:08:25,880 --> 00:08:27,760
It's dated 3 months ago,

143
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,920
a full 2 months

144
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:33,000
before Lin Shuang's thesis.

145
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:36,799
And this is

146
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:39,240
a statement from Mr. Li,

147
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:41,370
a renowned fashion designer in China.

148
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,240
Then whose thesis did we buy?

149
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,560
I don't know.

150
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:45,840
This is hers.

151
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:46,440
Yeah.

152
00:08:48,800 --> 00:08:51,320
Professor Li,

153
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:53,240
a leading fashion design expert in China,
has confirmed

154
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:56,440
that Xie Nanfeng's original draft
is indeed her own work.

155
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:59,720
Lin Shuang's thesis is suspected of
serious plagiarism.

156
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:00,400
Effective immediately,

157
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:03,260
her Outstanding Graduate Certificate
is revoked,

158
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:06,240
and so is her Shencheng
residency allocation.

159
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,600
No, Director.

160
00:09:08,350 --> 00:09:09,510
I'm innocent!

161
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:11,900
You can't take away my residency!

162
00:09:13,250 --> 00:09:14,090
Lin Shuang,

163
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:16,280
we saved up our allowance
to buy your designs.

164
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:17,400
And they were plagiarized?

165
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:17,800
Exactly.

166
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:19,160
Give us our money back,

167
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,280
or we'll report you!

168
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:20,960
Exactly.

169
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:21,440
Give us our money back.

170
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,680
You have to believe me!

171
00:09:22,680 --> 00:09:25,600
Give us our money back!

172
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:27,600
I'm sorry you got dragged into this.

173
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:33,680
Hurry up and pay back the money!

174
00:09:33,680 --> 00:09:34,800
We've been saving up for so long.

175
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:35,440
Come on. Pay us back.

176
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,360
Excuse me.

177
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:38,200
I'm with Xinxing Garment Factory.

178
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:40,240
We'd like to buy
your designs at a premium.

179
00:09:38,690 --> 00:09:40,170
[Xinxing Garment Factory—
Design Director Yang Yi]

180
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:50,720
It turns out that
when you live for yourself,

181
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:53,280
the world will make way for you.

182
00:09:55,800 --> 00:09:57,280
Thank you for your invitation.

183
00:09:57,280 --> 00:09:58,160
Regarding the cooperation,

184
00:09:58,160 --> 00:10:00,560
we will contact you later
when we have time.

185
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:02,480
Okay.
